    "blurb": "Store, process, and manage large-scale data",
    "overview": "Optimize Camunda-based processes by storing, processing, and managing large-scale AI/ML data, files, and more with MinIO's high-performance, Amazon S3-compatible object storage.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Scalable Data Management with MinIO",
    "splashDescription": "MinIO is an open source distributed object storage system that is built for large-scale AI/ML, data lake, and database workloads. It allows you to store and manage large amounts of data, such as files, images, videos, and other types of data as objects. It is also compatible with Amazon S3. This Connector allows you to integrate MinIO's storage capabilities into your Camunda-based processes. Store, process, and manage large amounts of data during business process execution in a convenient, scalable form.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/449511/overview/img3946987522382053690.png?435ae54668d89b141c30fe75fe5e8849",
